  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A train is moving in a straight line away from a stationary observer when the train horn emits a sound of frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f_{0}\"></span>. The speed of the train is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.10v\"></span> where <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> is the speed of sound. What is the frequency of the horn as heard by the observer?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{0.9}{1}f_{0}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{1.1}f_{0}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1.1}{1}f_{0}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{0.9}f_{0}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
